      "type": "RUPS",
      "detail": "Waktu: 09:50:00 · Lokasi: Ciputra Artpreneur Gallery, Lotte Shopping Avenue LT. 11, Ciputra World 1 Jakarta, JL. Prof. Dr. Satrio Kav. 3-5, Karet Kuningan, Jakarta Selatan 12940 Kota Adm. Jakarta Selatan Dki. Jakarta · Agenda #1: Approval of Annual Report and Financial Statements. The shareholders approved the annual report including the supervisory report and ratified the consolidated financial statements for the fiscal year ending 31 December 2025, granting full discharge (acquit et decharge) to directors and commissioners, with a quorum of 79.73% and 99.35% voting in favor.\nAgenda #2: Approval of Use of Net Profit and Cash Dividend. The shareholders approved allocating the FY2025 net profit of Rp2.663 trillion to reserves (Rp1 billion), retained earnings (Rp1.9948 trillion), and a cash dividend of Rp36 per share totaling Rp667.285 billion, payable on 24 July 2026, with 99.543% in favor.\nAgenda #3: Approval of Appointment of Public Accounting Firm. The shareholders approved the appointment of Liana Ramon Xenia & Rekan (LRX) to audit the consolidated financial statements for the fiscal year ending 31 December 2026, and authorized the Board of Commissioners to set the audit fee and appoint a replacement firm if necessary, with 99.559% in favor.\nAgenda #4: Determination of Remuneration for Directors and Commissioners for Fiscal Year 2026. The shareholders approved a 5% increase in remuneration for the Board of Commissioners relative to 2025 and granted full authority to the Board of Commissioners to set director remuneration for fiscal year 2026, with 92.189% in favor.\nAgenda #5: Approval of Amendment to Article 3 of the Articles of Association. The shareholders approved changes to align business scope with the 2025 Indonesian Business Field Classification (KBLI 2025) per BPS Regulation No. 7 of 2025, and authorized the Board of Directors to execute administrative actions, with 99.559% in favor."
